                                "sense_id": "e64ce8e3-ab77-3169-88a7-b915a0591b6d",
                                "text": "Пе́рвый у́тренний ветеро́к без шо́роха, осторо́жно шевеля́ молоча́ем и бу́рыми сте́блями прошлого́днего бурья́на, пробежа́л вдоль доро́ги.",
                                "translation": "The first noiseless breeze of morning, cautiously stirring the spurges and the brown stalks of last year's grass, fluttered along the road.",
                                "english": "The first noiseless breeze of morning, cautiously stirring the spurges and the brown stalks of last year's grass, fluttered along the road."
                            }
                        ]
